"html": "<h1 class=\"o o-t\" data-o=\"Titlu\" data-cue=\"0\" data-fx=\"fade\" style=\"left:96px;top:130px;width:499.4px;height:60.7px;z-index:1;--d:250ms;--t:500ms\"><span class=\"tx\" style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px\"><span class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:53.3px;line-height:58.7px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700\">RISCURI. SOLUȚII</span></span></h1><div class=\"o\" data-o=\"shp_Card1\" data-cue=\"1\" data-fx=\"float\" style=\"left:96px;top:250px;width:848px;height:260px;z-index:2;background:#BDD7EE;--d:0ms;--t:700ms\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"padding:44px 44px 30px 44px\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:38.4px;margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700\">Subiectul nu se decupează corect în mod automat</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:29.3px;color:var(--ink)\">Folosește un PNG transparent sau Mask.</p></div></div><div class=\"o\" data-o=\"shp_Card2\" data-cue=\"2\" data-fx=\"float\" style=\"left:976px;top:250px;width:848px;height:260px;z-index:3;background:#C5E0B4;--d:0ms;--t:700ms\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"padding:44px 44px 30px 44px\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:38.4px;margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700\">Totul se mișcă prea mult</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:29.3px;color:var(--ink)\">Animează doar 1–2 straturi principale.</p></div></div><div class=\"o\" data-o=\"shp_Card3\" data-cue=\"3\" data-fx=\"float\" style=\"left:96px;top:542px;width:848px;height:260px;z-index:4;background:#FFF2CC;--d:0ms;--t:700ms\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"padding:44px 44px 30px 44px\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:38.4px;margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700\">Clipul trece de 15 s</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:29.3px;color:var(--ink)\">Scurtează marginile clipurilor.</p></div></div><div class=\"o\" data-o=\"shp_Card4\" data-cue=\"4\" data-fx=\"float\" style=\"left:976px;top:542px;width:848px;height:260px;z-index:5;background:#E8E5DB;--d:0ms;--t:700ms\"><div class=\"tx\" style=\"padding:44px 44px 30px 44px\"><p class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:38.4px;margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700\">Exportul arată diferit</p><p class=\"p\" style=\"font-size:29.3px;color:var(--ink)\">Verifică rezoluția și formatul.</p></div></div>"
